  ('1a38d9c6-9ad6-5440-88cd-0e487c69829d', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g12-argument-writing'), null, 'medium',
   $q$The writer wants to add evidence after sentence (9) to strengthen the response to the safety officials. Which sentence is most relevant?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Pollinating insects are responsible for much of the fruit grown on farms in the region.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"off-point-evidence"},{"text":"County engineers measured sight distances at all fourteen test intersections and found every one met the state minimum.","is_correct":true},{"text":"One resident told the county that the unmowed test miles looked untidy and neglected.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"undercuts-argument"},{"text":"Many drivers say they enjoy seeing wildflowers along quiet country roads in summer.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-appeal"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$County engineers measured sight distances at all fourteen test intersections and found every one met the state minimum.$q$, $q$The objection is about drivers' view of traffic, and measured sight distances answer it directly. The fact about fruit supports the benefits of pollinators but does nothing to address the safety concern.$q$, 'draft', 'c7f9829b-1780-5ee6-8676-7632991edbf2')
